    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Precomputed BBQ codes and corrections in caller-owned device buffers.</para>
<para>Codes are packed rows in codeLayout with a 4-byte aligned base pointer. Each correction array has one entry per row; centroid has dim entries of the <ref refid="classfaiss_1_1gpu_1_1Dataset" kindref="compound">Dataset</ref> numeric type. Corrections must have been generated for metric. All buffers must outlive uses of the <ref refid="classfaiss_1_1gpu_1_1Dataset" kindref="compound">Dataset</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
